  "description": "All-rounder for city and off-road: The GHOST E-ASX Universal EQ is a full-suspension e-mountain bike perfectly tuned for urban use. Equipped with lights, mudguards, and a rear rack, the E-ASX Universal EQ is an ideal e-bike for everyday urban use. The robust aluminum frame and generous suspension travel of 160mm at the front and 150mm at the rear make short work of cobblestones, curbs, and rooty trails. The powerful Bosch motor and 800WH battery give you the power and range you need for your daily commutes and long tours. This bike combines top comfort with solid equipment—perfect for off-road adventures and the last mile.",
